      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "14 tr by 7 rounds = 10 x 10 cm in fingering with a 3.5 mm hook, blocked. Swatch flat if you prefer; the stitch gauge is identical in round."
